BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cat-reg-opens-2026@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260802
SUMMARY:[P1] CAT 2026 registration OPENS — register today
DESCRIPTION:Register at iimcat.ac.in (fee ~Rs 2600). Final-year students allowed. Exam is Nov 29 2026. Also start applying to Google / Amazon / Microsoft / Freshworks internship portals (open Aug–Oct for summer 2027).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nmat-reg-2026@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260816
SUMMARY:[P1] Register NMAT by GMAC (3 attempts allowed)
DESCRIPTION:mba.com/exams/nmat — Rs 3000 per attempt. Registration open Aug to mid-Oct. Exam window Nov–Dec 2026. Backup to CAT.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:infosys-tcs-apply-2026@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260902
SUMMARY:[P1] Apply Infosys InStep + TCS internships (April 2027 cycle)
DESCRIPTION:InStep: infosys.com/instep/internship.html · TCS: tcs.com/careers/india/internship. Very competitive — apply early.
END:VEVENT
