BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kerala-tn-apply-2026@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:[P1] Apply Kerala + Tamil Nadu companies (incl. IBS Software — travel tech!)
DESCRIPTION:December wave: UST Global, IBS Software (travel-tech, directly relevant to Pack and Pass), Tata Elxsi, Infosys BPM, SpiderWorks, Zuan, Codingmart, W3Squad.
