BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:followup-jan-2027@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270104
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270105
SUMMARY:[P1] Follow up ALL internship applications + apply agencies as backup
DESCRIPTION:Chase every pending application. If no MNC offer, apply digital agencies (Zuan, SpiderWorks, W3Squad) — portfolio-building first internship.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:internship-start-2027@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270401
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270402
SUMMARY:[P1] Graduation month — START INTERNSHIP
DESCRIPTION:Coursework complete. Internship April–July 2027. Cover all 5 skill areas: SEO, paid ads, funnels/email, content/social, analytics.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:convert-offer-2027@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270615
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270616
SUMMARY:[P1] Push to convert internship → full-time offer
DESCRIPTION:Ask about conversion now, before the internship ends. If no conversion path, start applying out with the internship as proof.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:schwarzman-um-2027@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270902
SUMMARY:[P1] Schwarzman Scholars deadline (Sep) + contact UM supervisors
DESCRIPTION:Schwarzman (Tsinghua) has an under-29 age limit — check eligibility and apply this cycle if needed. Also email University of Malaya supervisors for the Oct 2027 scholarship cycle.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gmat-take-2027@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271002
SUMMARY:[P2] Take GMAT (target 650–680+)
DESCRIPTION:Score valid 5 years — banked for NUS/NTU 2030 applications. mba.com/exams/gmat-focus-edition
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:csc-prep-2027@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271102
SUMMARY:[P1] Start CSC (China) scholarship application prep
DESCRIPTION:Highest-odds full scholarship (35–50%). Full tuition + RMB 3000/month + accommodation. Apply BOTH embassy track (Type A) and university track (Type B). chinesescholarshipcouncil.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:path-decision-2027@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271202
SUMMARY:[P1] DECISION POINT: Path A (MBA now) vs Path B (work 3 years)
DESCRIPTION:Path A if no strong job or a full-ride comes through. Path B (default) if you have a good tech marketing job — experience + salary funds Pack and Pass and strengthens Chevening/NUS/NTU. Also: Aga Khan Foundation application this month.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tipp-apply-2028@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280106
SUMMARY:[P1·Path A] Apply Thailand TIPP scholarship
DESCRIPTION:2nd highest odds (30–45%). Chulalongkorn/Thammasat English MBA. Full tuition + THB 7000/month. mua.go.th/users/tipp
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:packpass-launch-2028@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280116
SUMMARY:[P3·Path B] LAUNCH Pack and Pass as a side business
DESCRIPTION:Register sole proprietorship/MSME + GST. Plan first paid group trip (6–12 people, Bali/Vietnam budget tier ~Rs 50k/head). Learn visa-filing workflows, supplier negotiation, agency accounting. Optional: IATA Foundation cert.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brunei-contact-2028@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280202
SUMMARY:[P1·Path A] Contact Brunei High Commission (New Delhi)
DESCRIPTION:Brunei Government Scholarship — massively undersubscribed by Indians. Deadline May 2028. Full tuition + BND 500/month + accommodation + airfare.
END:VEVENT
