DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280331
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280401
SUMMARY:[P1·Path A] Aga Khan Foundation deadline Mar 31
DESCRIPTION:50% grant + 50% loan. Requires university admission secured first.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dikti-deadline-2028@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280403
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280404
SUMMARY:[P1·Path A] Indonesia DIKTI scholarship deadline (April)
DESCRIPTION:UI/UGM English MBA. Very few Indian applicants. Also Thailand TIPP final deadline is Mar–Apr.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brunei-cimb-2028@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280502
SUMMARY:[P1·Path A] Brunei deadline (May) + CIMB ASEAN (May–Jun)
DESCRIPTION:Fallback if all scholarships fail: self-fund UNITAR 100% online MBA (Rs 2.76L total, study from India while working) or FTU Hanoi (Rs 2.5–4.2L).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fulbright-2028@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280715
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280716
SUMMARY:[P1·optional] Fulbright-Nehru window opens (USA route)
DESCRIPTION:Essays take ~6 months to write well. Only if the USA route interests you. usief.org.in
