BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chevening-essays-2029@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20290801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20290802
SUMMARY:[P1·Path B] Start Chevening essays (deadline November)
DESCRIPTION:4 essays. 150+ India awards/year. You'll have 2+ years of experience by now — required minimum met. chevening.org/apply
END:VEVENT
