UID:chevening-deadline-2029@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20291101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20291102
SUMMARY:[P1·Path B] Chevening deadline (November 2029)
DESCRIPTION:Full tuition + stipend + flights + visa, any UK university.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sisgp-2030@ryan-career
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20300201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20300202
SUMMARY:[P1·Path B] Swedish Institute SISGP deadline (February)
DESCRIPTION:Requires 3000 logged work/volunteer hours — you have been logging since 2027. Full tuition + SEK 11000/month + travel.
